   304          // 28-Sep-2016, tatu: As per [databind#1385], we do need to do some juggling
   305          //    to use different Object for type id (logical type) and actual serialization
   306          //    (delegate type).
   307  
   308          // 16-Apr-2018, tatu: What seems suspicious is that we do not use `_valueTypeSerializer`
   309          //    for anything but... it appears to work wrt existing tests, and alternative
   310          //    is not very clear. So most likely it'll fail at some point and require
   311          //    full investigation. But not today.
   312          TypeSerializerRerouter rr = new TypeSerializerRerouter(typeSer0, bean);
   313          ser.serializeWithType(value, gen, ctxt, rr);
